# User-journey E2E coverage

When a user journey in [`docs/app-flows.md`](docs/app-flows.md) is added/removed/behaviorally changed:

1. Ensure the journey lists one or more Playwright specs in `e2e/`.
2. Long journeys may split across multiple specs.
3. Add/adjust E2E with the screen/code change (do not defer it to a later diagram update). Do not create git commits.
4. Cover the reachable UI; do not invent brittle camera-frame injection for barcode decode.

Skip if the change cannot affect a documented journey.
